": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_934153102486385_341434832440931052_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nHf2iJO4D_sQ7kNvwGLDOz8&_nc_oc=Adq_TPWxINO6gcicwa5g2S4pQwgUnJJP3pZttQlyPfOmzS1B04moYB-Vh6Nt3MtmLtg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPSQh2UpNRJnZqezbce6CGdUUuxNNbMYM9-Mp1Mf5rrYg&oe=6ADDF1B2"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-07.png", "id": "1080330658495695", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_1080330661829028_1720857723477002214_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mGNTivXEfMcQ7kNvwEe6xOR&_nc_oc=AdoXZzFRU_oas_rHZb2Wws_3fcatwArbTPlQf0GdDYcTwWr12dfsYtW9t9L4vsgGPx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPhJPXdd0XoBCPL08vqYQNLFer6_bjf-amO2fmKu1b0rQ&oe=6ADE0397"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-03.png", "id": "907736915337764", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824203_907736918671097_3835084709530844411_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A1uPDFFwGicQ7kNvwHV7WL9&_nc_oc=AdqujP_BNHgjwKUdbPVcp1n8XONHqQcGk3M627xqx7TJYQHRehrci-6SI6xAVSRtfvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMIXKIm67pS5OCRtIqhSVqhyTTKrcb8jfogQuneS4VHpA&oe=6ADE08E5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "MainHero.png", "id": "2028621527692629", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821725_2028621531025962_8689135822510397441_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uDanKWM6-HwQ7kNvwFz2g6e&_nc_oc=Adq0x8p4tIkd07U_W63zXdFAaH70dd1hk1YA0BaHQqU_biDgi1R2tfGAxuej7rZOw9Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP9uQEpWI6qQ5YF1-AQLno6saIsmoMQ9FO7n14ZIZK-zQ&oe=6ADE0F29"}, "display_name": "DustCrow", "keywords": ["space", "salvage", "zerog", "simulation", "exploration"], "long_description": "# SARIS INDUSTRIES IS HIRING\n\nThe job is simple. head out to derelict wrecks, strip anything of value, and haul it back to the station.\n\nDustCrow is a methodical simulation built around zero-gravity physics. This is not an arcade game. There are no \"heroics\" here - just the physical reality of moving heavy scrap, using industrial tools to dismantle ships, and managing your momentum so you do not drift into the void.\n\n**THE WORK**\n- Physically cut, grab, and stow salvage using tactile tools.\n- Navigate abandoned satellites, lost cargo and long forgotten wrecks.\n- Sell your haul in a live economy where supply and demand shift based on what other players bring in.\n- Listen to Eli, your ops tech, who monitors you out in space and provides support from the station.\n\n**THE GRIND**\n\nThis is for the players who enjoy the process. Enjoy exploration. Enjoy pushing out into the unknown, striving to go further.\n\n**EARLY ACCESS STATUS**\n\nCurrent build includes:\n\n- The full salvage to sell gameplay loop.\n- Procedural wreck environments.\n- Helpful tools for deep space salvaging.\n- Live player driven economy.\n- \n\n**THE ROADMAP**\n\n- Multiplayer support.\n-  Player Cosmetics & Customisation.\n- Player progression systems.\n- Lots more tools and utility.\n- Brand new POI's to go to and expansions on the current ones.\n- More voiced content.\n- Expanded lore.\n\nClock in. Scavenge. Get paid.\n{1502287521562266}", "short_description": "Clock in. Scavenge. Get paid.\n\nJoin SARIS Industries as a zero-g salvage contractor. Navigate derelict wrecks, physically strip valuable components with a variety of tools, and trade in a player-driven economy. No heroics here, just honest, methodical work in the silence of deep space."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nulleffectstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nulleffectstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "NullEffect Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nulleffectstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfo